{"resourceIdentifier":"4084","resourceName":"Arataú REDD Project","description":"The primary objective of the Arataú REDD Project is to avoid the unplanned deforestation (AUD) within the 25,417.85 ha project area, consisting of 100% Amazon rainforest. The project area is a private property, which is located in three different municipalities in the State of Pará: Tucuruí, Pacajá and Novo Repartimento. This project was designed as a grouped project, as to be able to increase its contribution to the standing forest with the addition of new project activity instances in the future.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, aiming at the propagation of environmental awareness, generation of alternative sources of income and environmental education actions.\r\n\r\nThe present REDD project is expected to avoid a predicted 11,105 ha of deforestation, equating to 5,414,313 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime, with an annual average of 180,478 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":-4.019294,"longitude":-50.091622},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-07","endExclusive":"2023-03-10","endInclusive":"2023-03-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4084"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Pará"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Carbon Holding S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"217988"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"25418 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 23/06/2022 - 22/06/2052"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84340&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87k116304860","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4084_06JAN2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-07T15:50:09.94Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82545&IDKEY=miofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3s113829555","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation - Aratau.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-12T01:03:21.653Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82546&IDKEY=m903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdff113830934","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"Aratau_Project Area.kml","uploadDate":"2023-01-12T01:03:46.653Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86355&IDKEY=9kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9092119083545","documentType":"Other","documentName":"Public_Comments_Summary_4084.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-13T14:10:58.863Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mym